<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of round-robin</p>
<p>matches in the Champions Trophy hockey tournament on Friday:</p>
<p>Netherlands 1 Australia 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Netherlands - Derk Buma Jaap 10</p>
<p>Australia - Baeden Choppy 61</p>
</text>
